cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this analysis code, please cite the associated article as indicated below."
title: "FAERS disproportionality analysis: bispecific antibodies versus CAR T-cell therapy in multiple myeloma"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline for a pharmacovigilance disproportionality study comparing the
  safety signalling profiles of bispecific antibodies (teclistamab, elranatamab,
  talquetamab) and BCMA-directed CAR T-cell products (idecabtagene vicleucel,
  ciltacabtagene autoleucel) using the FDA Adverse Event Reporting System (FAERS),
  2021 Q1 to 2026 Q2.
